"A mortal who licks the dregs from a mage's cast-off mana vial can wake to mana for nothing."
"A path that fits a mage like a glove makes a trash-poor talent climb faster than a genius."
"Impurities burned rather than cleared leave a sliver of super-pure mana behind."
"Skills bound to one's path level fast, so fast leveling hints at where one's path lies."
